nreleased whitebox MVP; use its local checkout instructions until its first npm release."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Install from a local checkout"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Use this flow when you are working from a `clutch-dsh` checkout and want to load a locally\nbuilt pac"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"kage into a DSH source checkout:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Replace the package name and path with the plugin you want to test. The package README contains\nthe "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"exact local build command and any package-specific development notes."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Plugins"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Plugin                                                                    | Preview               "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"                                                                                                    "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"                                         | What it does                                             "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"                                                                      |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `@cerbur/clutch-dsh-worktree`   |                                  | Adds a Git Worktree view that"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" groups DSH Sessions by Workspace, Worktree, and Session. The Dashboard is a plugin-only preview. |\n"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"| `@cerbur/clutch-dsh-fireworks` |                                   | Adds the `happy_fireworks` to"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ol and a short celebration overlay for meaningful milestones.                                     |\n"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"| `@cerbur/clutch-dsh-discuss`     |                                         | Adds `/discuss [topic"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"]`, an entry point for the bundled brainstorming workflow and reviewed design documents.            "},{"id":"p19s7","text":"      |\n| `@cerbur/clutch-dsh-title`         |                                         | Adds config"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"urable session title templates and a settings manager for new DSH Sessions.                         "},{"id":"p19s9","text":"                |\n| `@cerbur/clutch-dsh-office`       |  | Lists all native workspaces vertically as"},{"id":"p19s10","text":" 3D kitchens with up to two whale-girl Session characters. Unreleased MVP.            |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Install the workspace dependencies and run the repository checks from the root:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Useful focused checks are:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"To build, type-check, or test one package, use its package filter. Package-specific source\ninstallat"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ion and DSH compatibility notes live in that package's documentation."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The workspace root stays private. Its checks cover package shape, Cordis bundle patches,\nformatting,"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" linting, types, and tests; publishable plugins live under `packages/`."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- Plugin authoring guide — package shape, roles, and bundle patches.\n- Release guide — shared versio"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"n, worktree, pack, and publish workflow.\n- Worktree README — Git Worktree navigation and lifecycle.\n"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"- Fireworks README — milestone celebrations.\n- Discuss README — the `/discuss` brainstorming entry p"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"oint.\n- Title README — session title templates.\n- Office README — workspace kitchen visualization."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Friendly Links"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- LINUX DO — A new ideal community."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
